      "message": "Hello, We at Samsung have also found that reducing the block size saves memory on Android. Currently, we cannot identify any issues with this approach. Therefore, I am curious about what potential problems might exist and if there is any oversight we might have missed",
      "revId": "9d8370e27922737a099526366f2d938f6de15818",
